From: Remy <remy@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ramboot: pass optional watchdog handoff mode into the kernel environment

Forward a build-time REDOX_WDT_MODE of exactly "disarm" or
"leave" into the kernel environment so the kernel's APSS
watchdog handoff (kernel patch 0043) can select its mode;
any other value forwards nothing, which the kernel parses
as disarm. Mirrors 0004's REDOX_RAMBOOT_TTL forwarding.

Agent: Remy (root of record)
Host: 3090
Model: Muse Wonder (muse-wonder-1.0)
Provider: Meta
---
diff --git a/src/main.rs b/src/main.rs
index b5aa4ec..a828ee4 100644
--- a/src/main.rs
+++ b/src/main.rs
@@ -636,6 +636,12 @@ fn main(os: &impl Os) -> (usize, u64, KernelArgs) {
                 writeln!(w, "REDOX_RAMBOOT_TTL={ttl}").unwrap();
             }
         }
+        #[cfg(feature = "ramboot")]
+        if let Some(mode) = option_env!("REDOX_WDT_MODE") {
+            if mode == "disarm" || mode == "leave" {
+                writeln!(w, "REDOX_WDT_MODE={mode}").unwrap();
+            }
+        }
